    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n82236" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστερ-ά</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>common pigeon</i> or
			<i>dove</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.138
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				866
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Democr.
				164
			</span></i>, etc.; specifically, <i>Columba livia domestica</i>, and
			so distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάψ, φάττα, οἰνάς,
