				544b3
			</span></i> : <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιστερός</span></b> , ὁ, <i>cock-pigeon</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pherecr.
				33
			</span></i> (of a carrier-<i>pigeon</i>), <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				214
			</span></i> ; censured by <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Sol.</u>
				7
			</span></i>.</div>
